%I A402140 #6 Nov 23 2026 09:30:08
%S A402140 0,0,1,1,3,9,17,36,74,166,333,697,1414,2901,5944
%N A402140 Number of integer compositions of n that cover an initial interval of positive integers but are not a 1-based restricted growth sequence.
%C A402140 A 1-based restricted growth sequence of length j is a sequence (a_1, ..., a_j), satisfying a_1 = 1 and a_i <= 1 + max(a_1, ..., a_{i-1}) for all i = 2, 3, ..., j.
%e A402140 The a(1) = 0 through a(7) = 17 compositions:
%e A402140   .  .  (21)  (211)  (212)   (132)    (1132)
%e A402140                      (221)   (213)    (1312)
%e A402140                      (2111)  (231)    (1321)
%e A402140                              (312)    (2113)
%e A402140                              (321)    (2122)
%e A402140                              (2112)   (2131)
%e A402140                              (2121)   (2212)
%e A402140                              (2211)   (2221)
%e A402140                              (21111)  (2311)
%e A402140                                       (3112)
%e A402140                                       (3121)
%e A402140                                       (3211)
%e A402140                                       (21112)
%e A402140                                       (21121)
%e A402140                                       (21211)
%e A402140                                       (22111)
%e A402140                                       (211111)
%t A402140 comps[n_]:=Join@@Permutations/@IntegerPartitions[n];
%t A402140 rgoQ[y_]:=y[[1]]==1&&And@@Table[y[[i]]<=1+Max@@Take[y,i-1],{i,2,Length[y]}];
%t A402140 Table[Length[Select[comps[n],Union[#]==Range[1,Max@@#]&&!rgoQ[#]&]],{n,1,15}]
%Y A402140 This is the non-restricted-growth case of A107429 (ranked by A333217).
%Y A402140 For partitions instead of compositions we have A111133.
%Y A402140 This is the normal (or complete) case of A402138 (ranked by A402141).
%Y A402140 These compositions are ranked by A402143.
%Y A402140 A011782 counts compositions, strict A032020.
%Y A402140 A114901 counts compositions where each part is adjacent to an equal part.
%Y A402140 A345162 counts normal partitions with no wiggly permutation.
%Y A402140 A383253 counts compositions with 1-based restricted growth, ranks A402139.
%Y A402140 Cf. A000120, A002293, A008965, A047967, A055932, A080259, A333755, A344604, A345163, A383713, A402142.
